        "original_id": "0b00448e-cc42-562c-8661-8a84a6821ec5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: For Against, Aaroh\n- Albums: Echelons\n- Places: Lincoln, Nebraska; Karachi, Sindh, Pakistan; United States\n- Genres: post-punk, dream pop, alternative rock\n- Record Labels: Independent Project\n\nFacts:\n- For Against is a United States post-punk and dream pop band from Lincoln, Nebraska.\n- For Against began in 1984 and has produced material steadily from its inception to the present despite lineup changes and periods of dormancy.\n- Echelons is the debut studio album by American rock band For Against.\n- Independent Project released Echelons in 1987.\n- Aaroh is an alternative rock band from Karachi, Sindh, Pakistan, and it was formed in 1998.\n- Aaroh literally means \"the ascending scale in eastern classical music\" in Urdu.",
